  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/12/IMG_2067.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>El antiguo colegio Monteblanco de Onda ha acogido un a&ntilde;o m&aacute;s el concurso de p&aacute;jaros de canto timbrado.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/12/IMG_4366.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Tambi&eacute;n el Club de Colombicultura La Ondense ha celebrado su tradicional Trofeo del Pavo, con entrega de premios en el Bar Espa&ntilde;ol.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campionatscanttimbraticolomslaondense/img_0437.jpg\" alt=\"img_0437\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campionatscanttimbraticolomslaondense/img_0441.jpg\" alt=\"img_0441\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campionatscanttimbraticolomslaondense/img_0443.jpg\" alt=\"img_0443\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campionatscanttimbraticolomslaondense/img_0444.jpg\" alt=\"img_0444\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campionatscanttimbraticolomslaondense/img_0447.jpg\" alt=\"img_0447\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campionatscanttimbraticolomslaondense/img_0449.jpg\" alt=\"img_0449\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campionatscanttimbraticolomslaondense/img_0453.jpg\" alt=\"img_0453\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campionatscanttimbraticolomslaondense/img_2023.jpg